# Runner — kiem chung doi so va watchdog wall-clock
Chay voi mot 'make' gia in ra tung doi so; khong can Questa.

## Loi cu da sua
    exec make "${@:-clean all run}"
Trong dau nhay, gia tri mac dinh no ra MOT tu duy nhat nen make di tim target
ten 'clean all run'. Nghia la './run_sim.sh' khong tham so -- duong dung nhat --
luon hong voi 'No rule to make target'.

## Ket qua
### 1. khong tham so -> phai thay 3 dong ARG rieng biet, khong phai 1
RUNNER|make clean all run | SIM_TIMEOUT='40 ms' | WALL_TIMEOUT=1800s
ARG[clean]
ARG[all]
ARG[run]
RUNNER|PASS (exit 0)
   runner exit=0

### 2. co tham so
RUNNER|make clean all run INJECT_FAULT=1 | SIM_TIMEOUT='40 ms' | WALL_TIMEOUT=1800s
ARG[clean]
ARG[all]
ARG[run]
ARG[INJECT_FAULT=1]
RUNNER|PASS (exit 0)
   runner exit=0

### 3. make that bai (exit 3)
RUNNER|make clean all run | SIM_TIMEOUT='40 ms' | WALL_TIMEOUT=1800s
ARG[clean]
ARG[all]
ARG[run]
RUNNER|FAIL (exit 3)
   runner exit=3

### 4. mo phong TIMEOUT (vsim tra 124 do watchdog tang 1)
RUNNER|make clean all run | SIM_TIMEOUT='40 ms' | WALL_TIMEOUT=1800s
ARG[clean]
ARG[all]
ARG[run]
RUNNER|TIMEOUT mo phong - testbench khong ket thuc trong '40 ms'
   runner exit=124

### 5. make TREO -> watchdog tang 2 giet ca process group (WALL_TIMEOUT=3)
RUNNER|make clean all run | SIM_TIMEOUT='40 ms' | WALL_TIMEOUT=3s
ARG[clean]
ARG[all]
ARG[run]
RUNNER|WALL TIMEOUT sau 3s - giet process group 182358
RUNNER|BI GIET boi watchdog wall-clock (3s)
   runner exit=124

Quy uoc ma thoat:  0 = PASS   124 = TIMEOUT (mo phong hoac wall-clock)   khac = FAIL
